cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "The Energy Balance Project (EBU): a homeostatic field model and local actor-motion law"
abstract: >-
  A small, self-contained research model of homeostasis on a graph: can purely local
  rules keep a resource field viable indefinitely, with no central optimizer? Includes a
  conservation-audited simulation engine, a safe discrete movement law, regeneration
  (logistic/Allee/finite sources), protective harvest rules, and an EBU accounting layer
  whose guarded ledger (live-state causal credit against a threshold-aware burden, with
  transport and irreversible-extraction debits) closes gaming attacks that a naive ledger
  admits, without altering the underlying physics.
authors:
